    ],
    "text": "Notification made under Section 2(2) of the Entertainment Tax Ordinance No. 12 of 1946",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      380.65,
      539.98,
      475.72
    ],
    "text": "I, Prasanna Ranatunga, the Chief Minister and Minister of Finance and Planning, Law and Order, Land, Education, LocalGovernment and Provincial Administration, Manpower and Employment, Engineering Services and Information of the WesternProvince do hereby announce that the motion adopted by the Colombo Municipal Council on 31.07.2014 as per provisionsstated in Section 2(1) of Entertainment Tax Ordinance No. 12 of 1946 to enforce an entertainment tax of 10% from the entrancefee charged for entertainment affairs stated in Entertainment Tax Ordinance No. 12 of 1946 amended by Entertainment Tax(Amendment) Act, No. 37 of 1984 and to charge such fee for year 2015 and 2016, was approved as per powers vested in meby provisions of Section 2(2) of the Entertainment Ordinance No. 12 of 1946 which shall be read with Section 2 of theProvincial Councils (Consequential Provisions) Act, No. 12 of 1989.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
